  <h2>2. Quotation and Conclusion of Contract</h2>
  <p>
    Quotations are valid for 14 calendar days from the date of issue unless stated
    otherwise. The contract is concluded when the Client accepts the quotation in writing
    (e-mail is sufficient) or when Ebmeyer Consulting issues an order confirmation.
  </p>
  <p>
    The scope and content of the services result exclusively from the quotation or order
