  </p>
  <p>
    Payments already made will be refunded within 14 calendar days of receipt of the
    withdrawal, less the value of services already rendered.
  </p>

  <h2>14. Termination</h2>
  <p>
    The contract term follows the quotation or order confirmation. The right of both parties
